rds tabpanel-video tabpanel-media\" id=\"All\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(8)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202509301458595840595.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Allround PC: Technology\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      allround-pc.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Allround PC: Technology</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 impresses above all with its exceptional design highlight.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>09/29/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Allround PC: Technology\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.allround-pc.com/artikel/kuehlung/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb-im-test-wasserkuehlung-mit-mega-display-und-mega-kuehlleistung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202507042336178070239.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Basic-Tutorials Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      basic-tutorials.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Basic-Tutorials Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB is a superbly crafted compact water cooling system that really stands out thanks to its huge 6.67&quot; display and RGB fans. This compact water cooling system also offers excellent cooling performance and is easy to install.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>06/25/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Basic-Tutorials Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://basic-tutorials.de/tests/pc-hardware/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202506302152218670567.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwareinside recommendation Top class\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwareinside recommendation Top class</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG RYUO IV SLC 360 ARGB is without question an outstanding all-in-one water cooling system.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>06/23/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Hardwareinside recommendation Top class\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb-im-test-93177/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202410221501150850171.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardware Premium\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB revolutionizes liquid cooling with a 6.67-inch curved AMOLED display and 2K resolution, delivering an unprecedented visual experience.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>06/30/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarepremium.com/reviews/21241/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb-review-en-espanol/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/201911082047577070856.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardzone\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      a TOP liquid cooling with curved screen\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>05/26/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hardzone.es/reviews/disipadores-refrigeracion/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202501221812409910954.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"BUG Innovation award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Bug\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>BUG Innovation award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      High resolution and a solid refresh rate make it the best screen we've seen on a liquid cooler so far. Because of the excellent performance, you will be able to adjust it to prioritize nearly silent operation without the temperatures of even the most demanding processors exceeding the thermal limit.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>04/01/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of BUG Innovation award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bug.hr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202311090204287990300.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"BUG Innovation award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      BUG online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>BUG Innovation award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      We see the Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB as a product that will primarily be purchased by enthusiasts and those desiring the best possible screen on a liquid cooler. The performance of the entire system is at a commendable level, and we cannot overlook the new control app which offers incomparably higher stability in operation.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>01/16/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of BUG Innovation award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bug.hr/recenzije/asus-rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb-vrlo-posebna-vodenjaca-53728\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004100519000130488.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Advanced design award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Streberi\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Advanced design award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      That’s why my conclusion is simple: the ROG RYUO 4 SLC is for enthusiasts who want their build to look like it belongs in a showroom. If you’re in the ROG ecosystem and you want a centerpiece display that doesn’t resemble anything else on the market—this is it.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>06/26/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Ryuo IV SLC 360 ARGB Media review Award of Advanced design award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.streberi.rs/rog-ryuo-iv-slc-360-argb-recenzija-najludji-aio-do-sada/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"Product